$ An orphan continuation must not invent a fold header.
+ORPHAN,1,2,3
GRID,1,,0.,0.,0.
SET1,10,1,2,3,4,5,6,7,+A
$ comment between continuation records
+A,8,9
CUSTOM,42,,1.25-3 $ Unknown/custom card names still get card styling.
$ Quoted dollar signs are not comments; unmatched ordinary quotes end at EOL.
PARAM,NAME,'literal$inside'
PARAM,NAME,'unfinished
GRID,2,,1.,2.,3.
INCLUDE 'unfinished/path